<%#
  Shared vote widget — rendered by the feed card, the show page, AND re-rendered by
  votes/create.turbo_stream.erb. The wrapper id MUST match the Turbo-Stream replace
  target: dom_id(hujah, :vote_bars) => "vote_bars_hujah_<id>".

  Locals: hujah, current_user_vote (one of "agree"/"neutral"/"disagree"/nil).

  HOOJAH 2026 (redesign Phase 1, Task 1.2) — replaces the old per-stance 3-row layout
  (circular 44px button + 8px track + right-aligned percent, one row per stance) with
  the mockup shape (Hoojah-2026.dc.html ~228-247):

  - ONE segmented aggregate bar: all three stance counts share a single
    `flex h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden` track, each stance a `bg-<stance>` div
    sized `style="width: N%"` of the total. `gap-[2px]` seams the segments apart the
    way the mockup does rather than letting adjacent same-ish colours run together.
  - a percent legend directly under it, `flex justify-between`, one `text-<stance>
    text-xs font-bold` label per stance — the same numbers, now read as a caption
    for the bar instead of trailing each dead row.
  - three PILL vote buttons below that (icon + label, not a bare 44px circle):
    `rounded-xl border-[1.5px] border-<stance> text-<stance> bg-card`, equal-width
    (`flex-1`) with the stance glyph and its name. `active:scale-95` is the only press
    feedback, same call as before — see the latency note this replaces.

  VOTE-FEEDBACK LATENCY DECISION (Task 4.4 Step 5, still true): CSS-only, no
  vote_controller.js. Each stance button is a Turbo-driven button_to form; Turbo
  natively disables the submitter during the request and the same-origin round-trip
  is effectively instant, so a Stimulus controller would add nothing but code.
  Immediate press feedback comes from `active:scale-95` (CSS :active). Revisit only
  if a real deployment shows lag.

  The vote POST itself — path, method, `vote:` param, dom_id target — is UNCHANGED
  from the old layout: same `hujah_votes_path`, same `choice` (1/agree, 2/neutral,
  3/disagree) fed to VotesController -> Hujah#cast_vote. Only this wrapper markup
  moved; do not read this rewrite as touching the controller/route contract.

  This does NOT go through `ds_button_classes` even though it is now pill-shaped: the
  1.5px stance-coloured border and equal `flex-1` width are specific to this widget
  and the DS pill's variants (`px-5 py-2 text-base` / `px-4 py-1 text-sm`) fight a
  same-family override the same way the old circular button's note explained — see
  that reasoning in git history for the fuller version.

  Stance names are interpolated into `border-`/`bg-`/`text-`, which the Tailwind
  scanner cannot see; all three prefixes over the stance trio are covered by the
  `@source inline(...)` safelist in app/assets/tailwind/application.css.
%>
<%
  agree = hujah.agree_count.to_i
  neutral = hujah.neutral_count.to_i
  disagree = hujah.disagree_count.to_i
  total = agree + neutral + disagree
  rows = [["agree", 1, agree], ["neutral", 2, neutral], ["disagree", 3, disagree]]
  pct = rows.to_h { |stance, _choice, count| [stance, total.zero? ? 0 : (count * 100.0 / total).round] }
%>
<div id="<%= dom_id(hujah, :vote_bars) %>" class="px-4 py-3">
  <%# Secret ballot (2a/A7): below k=5 total votes the segmented bar + percent legend
      are a de-anonymization vector, so they are replaced by the total-only label. The
      vote buttons + own-stance highlight below still render. %>
  <% if hujah.breakdown_visible? %>
    <div class="flex h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden gap-[2px]">
      <% rows.each do |stance, _choice, _count| %>
        <div class="bg-<%= stance %>" style="width: <%= pct[stance] %>%"></div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between mt-2 text-xs font-bold">
      <% rows.each do |stance, _choice, _count| %>
        <span class="text-<%= stance %>"><%= pct[stance] %>% <%= stance %></span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-ink-2"><%= vote_total_label(hujah) %></div>
  <% end %>
  <div class="flex gap-2 mt-3">
    <% rows.each do |stance, choice, _count| %>
      <% voted = current_user_vote == stance %>
      <%= button_to hujah_votes_path(hujah.slug),
            params: { vote: choice },
            aria: { label: stance.capitalize, pressed: voted.to_s },
            class: "flex-1 h-11 rounded-xl border-[1.5px] border-#{stance} " \
                   "#{voted ? "bg-#{stance} text-white" : "bg-card text-#{stance}"} " \
                   "flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold transition active:scale-95" do %>
        <%= stance_icon(stance, class: "w-4 h-4") %>
        <%= stance.capitalize %>
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
